69-2.32,62.44,1.02,17.58,2.83,34.53,7.94,50.85,15.08,4.97,2.17,9.84,4.56,14.5,6.72,2.82-3.7,5.18-7.52,8.23-10.67,14.53-15.02,29.21-29.89,43.91-44.75C392.55,7.39,396.61,3.75,400.56,0c3.07,0,6.14,0,9.22,0Z\"></path></svg></div>\n						<div class=\"cms-panel__content\">\n							<h3>NUESTRA MISIÓN</h3>\n							<p>Nuestra misión es ayudar a emprendedores y tutores a crear su propia tutoría en línea\n								plataformas como Verbling, Preply y Cambly. Les ayudamos a alcanzar la cima de la\n								su carrera profesional, permiti&eacute;ndoles lanzar su propia plataforma de tutoría utilizando nuestro\n								solución lista para usar.</p></div></div>\n					<div class=\"cms-panel mb-5 pb-2\">\n						<div class=\"cms-panel__media\">\n							<svg iwidth=\"100\" height=\"100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewbox=\"0 0 512 512\">\n								<path d=\"M255.75,384.05c-14.05,0-28.11-.37-42.14.13-9.02.33-16.94-2.31-24.69-6.26-19.06-9.74-35.56-22.71-48.88-39.49-13.62-17.17-23.16-36.41-28.03-57.87-6.6-29.05-4.4-57.46,6.22-85.26,10.32-27.02,27.13-49.25,50.17-66.6,20.54-15.46,43.66-25.05,69.19-28.65,34.38-4.84,65.88,3.56,95,21.47,26.67,16.4,46.09,39.35,58.49,68.12,10.29,23.9,14.21,48.78,11.28,74.73-3.08,27.25-13.26,51.61-30.07,73.1-15.81,20.21-35.8,35.18-59.64,44.8-2.95,1.19-6.37,1.65-9.59,1.68-15.77.17-31.55.08-47.32.08ZM276.91,315.2c0,6.64-.02,13.27,0,19.91.02,4.77,2.16,6.91,6.96,6.96,5.34.05,10.69.06,16.03.03.83,0,1.73-.18,2.47-.54,11.02-5.35,21.14-12.1,29.48-21.08,28.13-30.32,36.25-65.64,24.26-105.03-7.84-25.76-23.93-45.78-47.23-59.53-20.95-12.36-43.45-17.92-67.84-13.94-24.49,4-45.24,15.03-62.11,33.2-15.92,17.14-25.12,37.51-27.93,60.65-2.2,18.11,0,35.77,7.15,52.65,10.38,24.52,27.68,42.47,51.69,53.95.61.29,1.3.55,1.96.55,5.51-.03,11.01-.16,16.52-.21,5.81-.05,7.42-1.59,7.42-7.31,0-13.01-.06-26.03.05-39.04.03-3.08-.9-5.41-3.12-7.55-11.04-10.64-21.97-21.4-32.98-32.08-3.12-3.03-5.19-6.59-6.28-10.78-1.93-7.44,1-16.58,6.23-20.96,8.72-7.32,21.45-6.83,30.08,2.02,6.74,6.91,13.63,13.67