		<div class=\"tile__media ratio ratio--3by4\"><img src=\"/image/editor-image/1650349417-ceo364x364.png\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n								<div class=\"tile__body\">\n									<h4>Stephen Fleming</h4>\n									<div class=\"card-element justify-content-center\"><span class=\"card-element__item\">CEO &amp; Fundador</span></div></div></div></div></div></div>\n				<div class=\"slider__item\">\n					<div class=\"tile-cover\">\n						<div class=\"tile\">\n							<div class=\"tile__head\">\n								<div class=\"tile__media ratio ratio--3by4\"><img src=\"/image/editor-image/1650349567-marketinghead364x3641.png\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n								<div class=\"tile__body\">\n									<h4>James Anderson</h4>\n									<div class=\"card-element justify-content-center\"><span class=\"card-element__item\">Jefe de Ventas/Marketing</span></div></div></div></div></div></div>\n				<div class=\"slider__item\">\n					<div class=\"tile-cover\">\n						<div class=\"tile\">\n							<div class=\"tile__head\">\n								<div class=\"tile__media ratio ratio--3by4\"><img src=\"/image/editor-image/1650349739-creativedirector364x3642.png\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n								<div class=\"tile__body\">\n									<h4>Nathan Astle</h4>\n									<div class=\"card-element justify-content-center\"><span class=\"card-element__item\">Director Creativo</span></div></div></div></div></div></div>\n				<div class=\"slider__item\">\n					<div class=\"tile-cover\">\n						<div class=\"tile\">\n							<div class=\"tile__head\">\n								<div class=\"tile__media ratio ratio--3by4\"><img src=\"/image/editor-image/1650349751-techlead364x3643.png\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n								<div class=\"tile__body\">\n									<h4>Marcos Boucher</h4>\n									<div class=\"card-element justify-content-center\"><span class=\"card-element__item\">Líder T&eacute;cnico </span></div></div></div></div></div></div>\n				<div class=\"slider__item\">\n					<div class=\"tile-cover\">\n						<div class=\"tile\">\n							<div class=\"tile__head\">\n								<div class=\"tile__media ratio ratio--3by4\"><img src=\"/image/editor-image/1650349756-saleshead364x3644.png\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n								<div class=\"tile__body\">\n									<h4>Steve Waugh</h4>\n									<div class=\"card-element justify-content-center\"><span class=\"card-element__item\">Jefe de Ventas/Marketing</span></div></div></div></div></div></div>\n				<div class=\"slider__item\">\n					<div class=\"tile-cover\">\n						<div class=\"tile\">\n							<div class=\"tile__head\">\n								<div class=\"tile__media ratio ratio--3by4\"><img src=\"/image/editor-image/1650349761-creativedirector2364x3645.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n								<div class=\"tile__body\">\n									<h4>Damien Martyn</h4>\n									<div class=\"card-element justify-content-center\"><span class=\"card-element__item\">Director Creativo </span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"section section--HowItWorks\">\n	<div class=\"section__header\" data-aos=\"fade-up\" data-aos-duration=\"1000\">\n		<h2>¿Cómo empezar a aprender con Platform?</h2></div>\n	<div class=\"section__body\" data-aos=\"fade-up\" data-aos-duration=\"1000\">\n		<nav class=\"inline-tabs\">\n			<ul class=\"js-tab list-unstyled\">\n				<li><a href=\"#tab__1\" class=\"current\">01. Buscar </a></li>\n				<li><a href=\"#tab__2\" class=\"\">02. Reservar </a> </li>\n				<li><a href=\"#tab__3\" class=\"\">03. Aprender </a> </li>\n			</ul></nav>\n		<div class=\"flex-layout-wrapper\" data-aos=\"fade-up\" data-aos-duration=\"1000\">\n			<div class=\"tab-container visible\" id=\"tab__1\">\n				<div class=\"flex-layout\">\n					<div class=\"flex-layout__media\"><img src=\"/image/editor-image/choose-your-tutor.png\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n					<div class=\"flex-layout__content\">\n						<div class=\"content\">\n							<h2>Busca entre cientos de los mejores profesores</h2>\n							<p class=\"p-large\">Utilice filtros como precio, idioma, competencia, tema, ubicación, para\n								Busca a tu profesor preferido</p>\n							<div class=\"step__actions\"> <a href=\"/teachers\" class=\"btn btn--primary\" tabindex=\"0\">Hojear\n									Tutores</a><a data-src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/q_Fy8DceWZM?autoplay=1\" class=\"btn btn--bordered color-secondary btn-video play-video\" tabindex=\"0\">\n									<svg class=\"icon icon--play\">\n										<use xlink:href=\"/images/sprite.svg#play\"></use></svg>Ver video</a> </div></div></div></div></div>\n			<div class=\"tab-container\" id=\"tab__2\">\n				<div class=\"flex-layout\">\n					<div class=\"flex-layout__media\"><img src=\"/image/editor-image/become-an-expert.png\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n					<div class=\"flex-layout__content\">\n						<div class=\"content\">\n							<h2>Reserva clases con el mejor profesor para ti</h2>\n							<p class=\"p-large\">Revisa el perfil del profesor y reserva una lección despu&eacute;s de hacer el\n								pago.</p>\n							<div class=\"step__actions\"> <a href=\"/teachers\" class=\"btn btn--primary\" tabindex=\"0\">Hojear\n									Tutores</a><a data-src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/q_Fy8DceWZM?autoplay=1\" class=\"btn btn--bordered color-secondary btn-video play-video\" tabindex=\"0\">\n									<svg class=\"icon icon--play\">\n										<use xlink:href=\"/images/sprite.svg#play\"></use></svg>Ver video</a> </div></div></div></div></div>\n			<div class=\"tab-container\" id=\"tab__3\">\n				<div class=\"flex-layout\">\n					<div class=\"flex-layout__media\"><img src=\"/image/editor-image/book-your-free-lesson.png\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n					<div class=\"flex-layout__content\">\n						<div class=\"content\">\n							<h2>Inicie sesión para comenzar a aprender</h2>\n							<p class=\"p-large\">Asiste a clases en línea y empieza a aprender.</p>\n							<div class=\"step__actions\"> <a href=\"/teachers\" class=\"btn btn--primary\" tabindex=\"0\">Hojear\n									Tutores</a><a data-src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/q_Fy8DceWZM?autoplay=1\" class=\"btn btn--bordered color-secondary btn-video play-video\" tabindex=\"0\">\n									<svg class=\"icon icon--play\">\n										<use xlink:href=\"/images/sprite.svg#play\"></use></svg>Ver video</a> </div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>');
