il} has been processed by the\r\n                                    Admin.<br />\r\n									                                    <br />\r\n									                                    Below are the updated details:\r\n                                </p>                                \r\n								<table style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; border-collapse:collapse; width:100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\">                                    \r\n									<tbody>                                        \r\n										<tr>                                            \r\n											<td style=\"padding:10px;font-size:13px;border:1px solid #ddd; color:#333; font-weight:bold;\" width=\"40%\">Request Status</td>                                            \r\n											<td style=\"padding:10px;font-size:13px; color:#333;border:1px solid #ddd;\" width=\"60%\">{request_status}</td>                                        \r\n										</tr>                                        \r\n										<tr>                                            \r\n											<td style=\"padding:10px;font-size:13px;border:1px solid #ddd; color:#333; font-weight:bold;\" width=\"40%\">Data Removed</td>                                            \r\n											<td style=\"padding:10px;font-size:13px; color:#333;border:1px solid #ddd;\" width=\"60%\">{data_removal_status}</td>                                        \r\n										</tr>\r\n<tr>                                            \r\n											<td style=\"padding:10px;font-size:13px;border:1px solid #ddd; color:#333; font-weight:bold;\" width=\"40%\">Reason(if declined)</td>                                            \r\n											<td style=\"padding:10px;font-size:13px; color:#333;border:1px solid #ddd;\" width=\"60%\">{declined_reason}</td>                                        \r\n										</tr>                                     \r\n									</tbody>                                \r\n								</table>                            </td>                        \r\n						</tr>                    \r\n					</tbody>                \r\n				</table>            </td>        \r\n		</tr>    \r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>', `etpl_vars` = '{username} User Full Name<br>\r\n{email} User Email<br>\r\n{request_status} Request Stauts<br>\r\n{data_removal_status} Data is removed or not<br>\r\n{declined_reason} Request declined reason<br>\r\n{website_name} - Website Name<br>' WHERE `tbl_email_templates`.`etpl_code` = 'delete_account_request_status_update_email' AND `tbl_email_templates`.`etpl_lang_id` = 1; UPDATE `tbl_email_templates` SET `etpl_body` = '\r\n<table width=\"600\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">    \r\n	<tbody>        \r\n		<tr>            \r\n			<td style=\"background:#fff;padding:0 40px; text-align:center; color:#999;vertical-align:top; border-bottom:1px solid #eee;\">                \r\n				<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">                    \r\n					<tbody>                        \r\n						<tr>                            \r\n							<td style=\"padding:20px 0\">                                \r\n								<h5 style=\"margin: 0;padding: 0; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 16px;font-weight: 500;color: #333;\">                                </h5>                                \r\n								<h2 style=\"margin:8px 0 0;padding: 0; font-size:30px;font-weight: 700;color: {primary-color};text-align:center;\">                                    تحديث طلب اللائحة العامة لحماية البيانات (GDPR)</h2>                            </td>                        \r\n						</tr>                    \r\n					</tbody>                \r\n				</table>            </td>        \r\n		</tr>        \r\n		<tr>            \r\n			<td style=\"background:#fff;padding:0 40px; text-align:left; color:#999;vertical-align:top; border-bottom:1px solid #eee; \">                \r\n				<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">                    \r\n					<tbody>                        \r\n						<tr>                            \r\n							<td style=\"padding:40px 0 60px;\">                                \r\n								<h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px;font-size: 24px; font-weight: 500; padding: 0;color: #333;text-align:center;\">                                    عزيزي {username}</h3>                                \r\n								<p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;color: #676767;\">حذف حسابك\r\n                                    تمت معالجة الطلب المرتبط بمعرف الحساب {email} بواسطة\r\n                                    المشرف.<br />\r\n									                                    <br />فيما يلي التفاصيل المحدثة:                                </p>                                \r\n								<table style=\"border:1px solid #ddd; border-collapse:collapse; width:100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\">                                    \r\n									<tbody>                                        \r\n										<tr>                                            \r\n											<td style=\"padding:10px;font-size:13px;border:1px solid #ddd; color:#333; font-weight:bold;\" width=\"40%\">حالة الطلب</td>                                            \r\n											<td style=\"padding:10px;font-size:13px; color:#333;border:1px solid #ddd;\" width=\"60%\">{request_status}</td>                                        \r\n										</tr>                                        \r\n										<tr>                                            \r\n											<td style=\"padding:10px;font-size:13px;border:1px solid #ddd; color:#333; font-weight:bold;\" width=\"40%\">البيانات التي تمت إزالتها</td>                                            \r\n											<td style=\"padding:10px;font-size:13px; color:#333;border:1px solid #ddd;\" width=\"60%\">{data_removal_status}</td>                                        \r\n										</tr>    \r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>                             